# Nougat parse — STUB (not run)

## Status
GPU-hosted Nougat parse **NOT executed** for this paper.

## Rationale
Ulyanenko et al. 2019 is an open-access IJMS publication with clean text layout.
`pdftotext` (poppler 24.02) extracted Tables 1–3 with sufficient fidelity for the
numerical replication (all three linear regressions reproduce to ≥ 3 decimal
places from the extracted numbers). Running a full Nougat pass on a GPU node would
add no new information for this specific paper.

## Provenance pointer
- **Source PDF:** `../source.pdf`
- **Source PDF SHA-256:** `9789205fcc4da37264a7efacdd7ac8677de2bdaae96863bee91316dd10ed8d5d`
- **Text extraction (used for the analysis):** `../source.txt` via
  `pdftotext -layout source.pdf source.txt`

## When to re-run Nougat
Re-run only if:
1. A follow-up needs equation-level parsing (this paper has essentially no
   in-line equations beyond the linear/hockey-stick fits already recovered).
2. The PDF SHA-256 changes (i.e., the publisher revises the paper).
3. Author supplementary raw-count files become available and need OCR.

## Re-run recipe (uicgpu, when needed)
```
ssh uicgpu
conda activate nougat
nougat source.pdf -o extraction/ --model 0.1.0-base --markdown
```
Output would land here as `nougat.mmd` (proper).
